WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.480
We always hear that imported is the best.

2
00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:04.680
But with transformers, the country of origin

3
00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:05.760
doesn’t mean quality.

4
00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:08.080
Experience and engineering are what decide.

5
00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:09.200
Anwar Kirkuk Factory —

6
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:10.320
the first factory in Iraq

7
00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:12.840
to produce electrical transformers and tanks

8
00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:14.900
with Iraqi engineering designs.

9
00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:20.860
What’s the difference between imported and ours?

10
00:00:20.860 --> 00:00:23.980
We worked on the design to reach a smaller size

11
00:00:23.980 --> 00:00:25.100
and higher efficiency,

12
00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:28.400
without a bigger size being the measure of power.

13
00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:31.710
Why import the solution

14
00:00:31.710 --> 00:00:33.070
if we can design it

15
00:00:33.070 --> 00:00:34.000
and make it here?

16
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:35.070
Even the tanks —

17
00:00:35.070 --> 00:00:36.630
not ready-made parts that we just fit,

18
00:00:36.630 --> 00:00:38.350
they’re made here, inside the factory,

19
00:00:38.350 --> 00:00:40.150
with a dedicated engineering design,

20
00:00:40.150 --> 00:00:44.430
so every part is calculated as part
of the transformer’s own system.

21
00:00:44.430 --> 00:00:46.950
From small ratings to larger ones,

22
00:00:46.950 --> 00:00:48.070
the goal is one:

23
00:00:48.070 --> 00:00:49.110
high efficiency,

24
00:00:49.110 --> 00:00:50.110
a well-studied design,

25
00:00:50.110 --> 00:00:52.300
better use of size.
